    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a rudimentary 2D platform decryption game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of level mechanisms make up over 40 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to make good use of their locking and portal abilities to solve puzzles one by one</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locking skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414730/extras/53ffa5b0675050ded93859eeb35f878c.poster.avif?t=1745222002\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414730/extras/53ffa5b0675050ded93859eeb35f878c.webm?t=1745222002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414730/extras/53ffa5b0675050ded93859eeb35f878c.mp4?t=1745222002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >pay attention to</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For proficient players in platform decryption, it may be a bit simple, but there may also be some surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lack of prompts, may cause blockage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are some bugs that developers cannot solve</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a rudimentary 2D platform decryption game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of level mechanisms make up over 40 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to make good use of their locking and portal abilities to solve puzzles one by one</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locking skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414730/extras/53ffa5b0675050ded93859eeb35f878c.poster.avif?t=1745222002\" width=400 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414730/extras/53ffa5b0675050ded93859eeb35f878c.webm?t=1745222002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414730/extras/53ffa5b0675050ded93859eeb35f878c.mp4?t=1745222002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >pay attention to</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For proficient players in platform decryption, it may be a bit simple, but there may also be some surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lack of prompts, may cause blockage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are some bugs that developers cannot solve</p></li></ul>",
